{"instance_id": "NCSU-High-Powered-Rocketry-Club__AirbrakesV2-151", "repo": "NCSU-High-Powered-Rocketry-Club/AirbrakesV2", "category": "Performance Issue", "issue": "Refactor logging to be more clear and performant\nAfter the changes in #146 in the logger to get #147 resolved, our logging process has slightly slowed down due to use of `msgpec.structs.asdict()` instead of `msgspec.to_builtins()`. We can still keep up with the IMU process, but the margin has reduced. \n\nI propose the following optimizations:\n\n1. Make `LoggerDataPacket` a msgspec Struct again. Cost of initializing a new Struct is much cheaper than converting existing ones to a dict anyway.\n2. The main process shouldn't be making the LoggerDataPacket into a dict, we can send it to the Logger process as a struct, and take advantage of the de/encoder now.\n\nRejected idea:\n1. We technically don't need to attach `Context` and `Servo` packets to every LoggerDataPacket, as that just increases the amount of bytes we need to transfer to the other process. But separating that from `LoggerDataPacket` is a bit too unclean, confusing, and increases development time.\n", "gold": ["airbrakes/airbrakes.py", "airbrakes/hardware/base_imu.py", "airbrakes/telemetry/logger.py", "airbrakes/utils.py"], "hybrid_top": [{"file": "airbrakes/telemetry/logger.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/hardware/imu.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/telemetry/packets/context_data_packet.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/mock/mock_imu.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/airbrakes.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/telemetry/packets/logger_data_packet.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/main.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/constants.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/hardware/servo.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/telemetry/packets/servo_data_packet.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/telemetry/packets/imu_data_packet.py"}, {"file": "scripts/run_servo_and_encoder.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/hardware/base_imu.py"}, {"file": "scripts/run_servo.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/telemetry/apogee_predictor.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/state.py"}, {"file": "scripts/run_logger.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/mock/display.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/mock/mock_logger.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/hardware/camera.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/simulation/sim_imu.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/simulation/data_generator.py"}, {"file": "scripts/run_imu.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/telemetry/packets/apogee_predictor_data_packet.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/telemetry/data_processor.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/utils.py"}, {"file": "README.md"}, {"file": "scripts/data_visualizer.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/telemetry/packets/processor_data_packet.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/simulation/rotation_manager.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/mock/mock_camera.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/simulation/sim_config.py"}, {"file": "scripts/run_camera.py"}, {"file": "launch_data/README.md"}, {"file": "airbrakes/simulation/sim_utils.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/simulation/random_config.py"}, {"file": "scripts/run_buzzer.py"}, {"file": "scripts/run_buzzer_gui.py"}, {"file": ".pre-commit-config.yaml"}, {"file": "airbrakes/hardware/__init__.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/mock/__init__.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/__init__.py"}, {"file": "scripts/__init__.py"}, {"file": "airbrakes/simulation/__init__.py"}, {"file": "legacy_project_setup.md"}, {"file": "pyproject.toml"}, {"file": ".github/workflows/benchmark.yml"}, {"file": "airbrakes/simulation/README.md"}, {"file": "airbrakes/telemetry/packets/__init__.py"}, {"file": "tests/test_components/test_logger.py"}, {"file": "tests/test_integration.py"}, {"file": "tests/conftest.py"}, {"file": "tests/test_main.py"}, {"file": "tests/test_airbrakes.py"}, {"file": "tests/test_packets/test_logged_data_packet.py"}, {"file": "tests/test_hardware/test_imu.py"}, {"file": "tests/test_components/test_data_processor.py"}, {"file": "tests/test_packets/test_context_packet.py"}, {"file": "tests/test_packets/test_servo_packet.py"}, {"file": "tests/test_packets/test_imu_data_packet.py"}, {"file": "tests/test_hardware/test_servo.py"}, {"file": "tests/test_compon